n":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3445834614/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446500321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112021#issuecomment-3446500321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112021","id":3446500321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NbWvh","user":{"login":"RoyalXXX","id":125651292,"node_id":"U_kgDOB31JXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125651292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX","html_url":"https://github.com/RoyalXXX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RoyalXXX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T10:13:54Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T10:17:31Z","body":"**Godot v3.6.2.stable.official** [3cd3caab6]\n**Windows 11 64-bit 25H2, 26200.6899**\n\nWhen I click on **Editor → Manage Export Templates**, Godot just crashes - the program window instantly closes without any errors or notifications.\nLaunching it with `--verbose` didn’t help to identify the cause of the crash either.\nThis issue doesn’t occur in the previous version (3.6.1).\n\n⚠️ **It’s clear that this issue affects all Windows users.** ⚠️","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446500321/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446543704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112021#issuecomment-3446543704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112021","id":3446543704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NbhVY","user":{"login":"SkanerSoft","id":13809475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODA5NDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13809475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft","html_url":"https://github.com/SkanerSoft","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SkanerSoft/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T10:31:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T10:31:06Z","body":"Linux Ubuntu 22.04 (x64) Crash in random time where opened window for manage templates.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446543704/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446549081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112021#issuecomment-3446549081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112021","id":3446549081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NbipZ","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T10:42:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T10:42:24Z","body":"Just to report these as possible causes:\n\n> Akien: Windows issues can often be reproduced with Wine on Linux.\n> Mbedtls issues might be caused by not having cherrypicked https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106167\n\n> When we first integrated mbedTLS, we decided not to enable MBEDTLS_THREADING_C (which adds mutex locking to calls modifying the state), and instead to simply create separate contexts (&quot;states&...\n\n> That's also why I was wary of the TLSv1.3 support, but I believe we disabled it by default. But this might still be needed.\n> The second crash is said to happen even when installing templates manually in which case mbedtls shouldn't be involved though.\n> The other big change in 3.6.2 is that I updated containers from Fedora 39 to 42 so we got a newer mingw-gcc. Windows crashes due to updates of mingw have happened in the past, that was a bit of a gamble to do this for 3.6.2 (I wanted to get things ready for 3.7 too so I don't have to do even more work there).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446549081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446775301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112021#issuecomment-3446775301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112021","id":3446775301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NcZ4F","user":{"login":"XDRiVE888","id":33435887,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDM1ODg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33435887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888","html_url":"https://github.com/XDRiVE888","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XDRiVE888/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-25T14:31:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-25T14:31:44Z","body":"> **Godot v3.6.2.stable.official** [[3cd3caa](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/3cd3caab6779a7f3ec3bbeb9f200db50c735cfc8)] **Windows 11 64-bit 25H2, 26200.6899**\n> \n> When I click on **Editor → Manage Export Templates**, Godot just crashes - the program window instantly closes without any errors or notifications. Launching it with `--verbose` didn’t help to identify the cause of the crash either. This issue doesn’t occur in the previous version (3.6.1).\n> \n> ⚠️ **It’s clear that this issue affects all Windows users.** ⚠️\n\nI fully confirm this bug. I have Win 10 Pro 22H2 Godot v3.6.2.stable.official [3cd3caab6]","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446775301/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3446993508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112021#issuecomment-3446993508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112021","id":3446993508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NdPJk","user":{"login":"a499209","id":83036671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzMDM2Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83036671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209","html_url":"https://github.com/a499209","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a499209/events{/privacy}","recei